flowchart TD
  API[Job API<br/>create · cancel · status] --> DB[(Jobs store<br/>partitioned by job id hash)]
  S1[Scheduler A<br/>owns partitions 0–7] -- "claim due jobs<br/>SKIP LOCKED + lease" --> DB
  S2[Scheduler B<br/>owns partitions 8–15] -- claim --> DB
  S1 --> Q{{Execution queue}}
  S2 --> Q
  Q --> W[Workers<br/>heartbeat · idempotent handlers]
  W -- "result · retry · dead" --> DB
  R[Reaper<br/>expired leases → retry] --> DB
